  "details": "If you hide chatboxes or only show them for friends, you'll see red dots whenever someone is typing, while I think this is good to have as the default behavior, I think it would also be good to have an option to turn this off completely.\n\nIf someone has no interest in seeing chatboxes from non-friends or at all, then there's no reason to have these appear, it only serves to distract and cause annoyance.",
